                <pb facs="1021" n="907" sameAs="frus:frus1931v01/pg907"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">825.01/47: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Culbertson</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-07-27T18:00:00-04:00">July 27, 1931—6
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>31. Your 82, July 27, noon. Department concurs in the view that no recognition of
                    new Chilean Government is necessary.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Castle</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
